# Cloudflare static-asset redirects. Vite copies this file from public/ into
# dist/, which is the directory wrangler.jsonc serves assets from.
#
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>
#
# Redirects are evaluated before the asset lookup, so a rule here wins over
# both a prerendered file and the 404 handling.

# Webflow appended a numeric suffix to disambiguate duplicate slugs, and that
# suffixed URL was crawled while the site was still on Webflow. After the
# migration it pointed at nothing, but not_found_handling was serving the
# prerendered homepage with a 200 — so AI crawlers kept treating this dead URL
# as a live page and reading homepage copy off it. Send it to the real post so
# the accumulated attention lands on the article it was always meant to be.
/blog/location-and-layout-details-33958 /blog/location-and-layout-details 301
